  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven : 36 + 8 × 184 - 23 ÷ 10 = 90\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs :\n\nOption 1): ÷ and -\n\n36 + 8 × 184 - 23 ÷ 10 = 90 ⇒ 36 + 8 × 184 ÷ 23 - 10 = 90\n\n36 + 8 × __**184 **____**÷**____** 23**__ - 10 = 90\n\n36 + __**8 × **__**__8__** - 10 = 90\n\n__**36 + **__**__64__** - 10 = 90\n\n__**100 - 10**__ = 90\n\n**90 = 90 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2): ÷ and ×\n\n36 + 8 × 184 - 23 ÷ 10 = 90 ⇒ 36 + 8 ÷ 184 - 23 × 10 = 90\n\n36 + __**8 **____**÷**____** 184**__ - 23 × 10 = 90\n\n36 + 0.04 - __**23 **____**×**____** 10**__ = 90\n\n__**36 + 0.04**__ - 230 = 90\n\n__**36.04 - 230**__ = 90\n\n-193.96 ≠ 90 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3): + and ×\n\n36 + 8 × 184 - 23 ÷ 10 = 90 ⇒ 36 × 8 + 184 - 23 ÷ 10 = 90\n\n36 × 8 + 184 - __**23 ÷ 10**__ = 90\n\n__**36 ×**____** 8**__ + 184 - 2.3 = 90\n\n__**288 + 184**__ - 2.3 = 90\n\n__**472 - 2.3**__ = 90\n\n469.7 ≠ 90 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4): - and +\n\n36 + 8 × 184 - 23 ÷ 10 = 90 ⇒ 36 - 8 × 184 + 23 ÷ 10 = 90\n\n36 - 8 × 184 + __**23 ÷ 10**__ = 90\n\n36 - __**8 × 184**__ + 2.3 = 90\n\n__**36 + 2.3**__ - 1472 = 90\n\n__**38.3 - 1472**__ = 90\n\n-1433.7 ≠ 90 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
